# Member Detail — design specification

Screen: `Member Detail` in `Gym App Mockups v2.dc.html` (`state.screen === "detail"`).
Reached from: Members list (row **View** / card tap), Action Center card **View**.
Exits to: Members (back arrow), Edit Member (**Edit**), Renew / Add Subscription (**Renew**, **+ Add** in Add-ons).

All values below are literal — the screen is inline-styled, no classes except the layout helper `.gm-detail-grid`.

---

## 1. Page frame

| Property | Value |
|---|---|
| Page background | `#fafafa` (app shell) |
| Content column | `max-width: 960px`, centred, `padding: 26px 20px 40px` |
| Card gap | `margin-bottom: 14px` (16px under the hero card) |
| Header | back button 32×32, radius 9px, `1px solid #e5e7eb` on `#fff`, icon `#6b7280`, 15px arrow; title 21px/700 `#111827`, gap 10px, `margin-bottom: 18px` |
| Variant chips | demo-only control row, `gap: 8px`, `margin-bottom: 14px` — remove in production |

### Vertical order (top → bottom)

1. **Hero card** — identity + membership strip (full width)
2. **Add-ons** (full width)
3. **Subscription history** (full width)
4. **Two-column row** — left: Medical, Emergency contact · right: Personal (collapsible)

Rationale: transactional, frequently-changed data first; static profile data last and partly collapsed.

### `.gm-detail-grid`

```css
.gm-detail-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.15fr;gap:0 16px}
@media (max-width:760px){ .gm-detail-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr} }
```

Each column is `display:flex;flex-direction:column`. Below 760px the row stacks: Medical → Emergency contact → Personal.

---

## 2. Card shell (used by every card)

```
background:#fff;
border:1px solid #f1f1f3;
border-radius:16px;      /* soft radius; sharp theme = 10px */
padding:20px 22px;
margin-bottom:14px;
```

Section title: `11.5px / 700 / #6b7280`, uppercase, `letter-spacing:.05em`, `margin-bottom:14px`
(no bottom margin when it sits in a flex header row next to a button).

---

## 3. Hero card

- Shell as above, `margin-bottom:16px`.
- Top row: `flex`, `align-items:center`, `gap:16px`, `flex-wrap:wrap`.
- **Avatar** 68×68, radius `tile` (16px soft / 10px sharp), background `tint.accent`, initials 21px/700 `#fff`.
- **Name** 19px/700 `#111827`; status badge beside it (gap 10px).
- **Meta line 1** 13px `#6b7280`, `margin-top:4px` — `FF-0231 · 98765 43210 · Female · joined 14 Feb 2026`.
- **Meta line 2** 12px `#6b7280`, `margin-top:3px` — `Handled by: …`.
- **Actions** right, `gap:8px`, `flex-shrink:0`: `Edit` (ghost) and `Delete` (danger ghost).

### Membership strip (inside hero, `margin-top:18px`, `padding:18px 20px`, radius 14px)

Three states, driven by membership status:

| State | Strip background / border | Label (11.5/700 uppercase) | CTA | Progress + footnote |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Active** | `linear-gradient(to bottom, tint.bg, #fff)` · `1px solid tint.border` | "Current membership", `tint.ink` | `Renew` | bar 92% `tint.accent`; foot `12 days remaining` `#6b7280` |
| **Expired** | `linear-gradient(to bottom, #fef2f2, #fff)` · `1px solid #fecaca` | "Membership expired", `#b91c1c` | `Renew now` | bar 100% `#dc2626`; foot `Expired 34 days ago · entry blocked at the gate` `#b91c1c` |
| **No plan** | `#fafafa` · `1.5px dashed #d1d5db` | "No active membership", `#6b7280` | `+ Add membership` | no bar, no footnote |

Strip body: plan 17px/700 `#111827` (`margin-top:6px`), meta 13px `#6b7280` (`margin-top:3px`).
Progress track: `height:6px`, radius 999px, `rgba(17,24,39,0.08)`, `margin-top:14px`, `overflow:hidden`; footnote 11.5px/500, `margin-top:6px`.
CTA button: `padding:9px 16px`, radius `el` (12px soft / 6px sharp), no border, `background-image: <theme CTA gradient>`, 13px/600 `#fff`, `white-space:nowrap`.

