## 4. Add-ons (full width)

- Header row: `flex`, `space-between`, `align-items:center`, `margin-bottom:12px` — title left, `+ Add` ghost button right (opens Renew).
- Row: `flex`, `space-between`, `align-items:center`, `gap:12px`, `padding:10px 0`, `border-bottom:1px solid #f5f5f6`. Last row: `padding:10px 0 0`, no border.
- Row left: name 13.5px/600 `#111827`; sub-line 12px `#6b7280`, `margin-top:2px` (`till 5 Aug 2026`).
- Row right: status badge — `Active` `#dcfce7`/`#15803d`, `Expiring Soon` `#fef3c7`/`#b45309`, `Expired` `#fee2e2`/`#b91c1c`.
- Empty state: dashed `1.5px #d1d5db` panel on `#fafafa`, 13px `#6b7280` copy + `+ Add` action (same pattern as Renew / Action Center empties).

Badge recipe: `display:inline-block;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:<pill>;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;`

