## 5. Subscription history (full width)

- Row: `flex`, `align-items:flex-start`, `gap:10px`, `padding:9px 0`, `border-bottom:1px solid #f5f5f6`.
- Dot: 8×8, radius 999px, `margin-top:5px`, `flex-shrink:0`. Colour by kind — membership `tint.accent`, add-on `#b45309`, past/inactive `#6b7280`.
- Title 13px/600 `#111827`; meta 11.5px `#6b7280`, `margin-top:1px` — `range · payment mode · by <staff>`.
- Amount right, 12.5px/600 `#374151`, `flex-shrink:0`.
- Newest first. Show 4 rows; paginate or "View all" beyond that (not yet designed).

