## 8. Tokens used on this screen

**Colour roles per tint** (`accent` = fills/bars/tiles, `ink` = text + icons ≥4.5:1, `solid` = fills carrying white labels, `onPill` = text on `pillBg`):

| Tint | bg | border | accent | ink | solid | pillBg | onPill | CTA gradient |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| wild | `#fff4f0` | `#ffdccf` | `#ff5a2c` | `#c2410c` | `#c2410c` | `#ffe4d9` | `#9a3412` | `linear-gradient(145deg,#c2410c,#9a3412)` |
| sky | `#eff6ff` | `#dbeafe` | `#2563eb` | `#1d4ed8` | `#1d4ed8` | `#dbeafe` | `#1e3a8a` | `linear-gradient(to bottom,#374151,#111827)` |
| violet | `#f5f3ff` | `#ede9fe` | `#7c3aed` | `#6d28d9` | `#6d28d9` | `#ede9fe` | `#5b21b6` | `linear-gradient(to bottom,#374151,#111827)` |

**Neutrals** — ink `#111827`, body `#374151`, secondary `#6b7280` (4.8:1 on white), disabled `#9ca3af` only, hairline `#f5f5f6`, card border `#f1f1f3`, control border `#e5e7eb`, surface `#fff`, page `#fafafa`.

**Status** (reserved for membership/add-on state, never decorative) — active `#dcfce7`/`#15803d`, expiring `#fef3c7`/`#b45309`, expired `#fee2e2`/`#b91c1c`, none `#f3f4f6`/`#6b7280`.

**Radii** — soft: card 28 / element 12 / tile 16 / pill 999. sharp: 10 / 6 / 10 / 6. Cards on this screen use a fixed 16px shell radius; `tile`, `el` and `pill` follow the theme.

**Type scale** — 21 / 19 / 17 / 13.5 / 13 / 12.5 / 12 / 11.5 px; weights 400 · 500 · 600 · 700; section labels uppercase with `.05em` tracking.

**Buttons**
- Ghost: `padding:8px 14px`, radius `el`, `1px solid #e5e7eb`, `#fff`, 12.5px/500 `#374151`, `white-space:nowrap`
- Danger ghost: same box, `1px solid #fecaca`, 12.5px/600 `#dc2626`
- CTA: `padding:9px 16px`, radius `el`, no border, theme gradient, 13px/600 `#fff`

