## 9. Behaviour notes

- `Renew`, `Renew now`, `+ Add membership` and Add-ons `+ Add` all open **Renew / Add Subscription** pre-scoped to this member; the Add-ons entry pre-selects the Add-on category.
- `Edit` opens **Edit Member** with fields pre-filled; the profile data on this screen is read-only here.
- `Delete` should confirm in a modal (not yet designed) and is permission-gated.
- "Handled by" is editable by managers only.
- Personal disclosure state is local to the screen — not persisted.

## 10. Open items

- Confirmation modal for Delete.
- "View all" / pagination for Subscription history beyond 4 rows.
- Attendance or check-in history block, if it belongs on this screen.
